  "body": "Finding a modern home that adapts to multi-generational living, adult children, or a private home business is rare. Just four years young, 26 Paparahi Place delivers this versatility, combining a dedicated ground-floor suite with expansive dual-level living, set against a peaceful redwood backdrop.\r\n\r\nGround Floor: Self-Contained Versatility:\r\n\r\n• Private Guest/Work Suite: Features its own exterior entrance, walk-in wardrobe, and ensuite. Ideal for extended family, boarders, or running a client-facing home business with total privacy.\r\n\r\n• Chef's Kitchen: Built with quality engineered stone benchtops and seamless flow into the open-plan dining and living areas, with high stud ceilings and lots of natural light.\r\n\r\n• Outdoor Living: Living space opens directly onto a hardwood entertaining deck and landscaped garden bathed in afternoon sun.\r\n\r\n• Added Extra:  A separate guest powder room.\r\n\r\nUpper Level: Family Comfort & Views:\r\n\r\n• Primary Master Suite: Features a large walk-in wardrobe, fully tiled ensuite, and a private balcony overlooking the natural redwood reserve.\r\n\r\n• Second Living Zone: A substantial upstairs lounge—ideal as a media room, kids' retreat, or second living space.\r\n\r\n• Additional Bedrooms: Two further double bedrooms served by a stylish, fully tiled family bathroom.\r\n\r\n• Added Extra: Dedicated study / office space\r\n\r\nModern Comfort & High Specifications:\r\n\r\n• Year-Round Climate Control: Equipped with 3 heat pumps, full insulation, and double glazing for efficiency and warmth.\r\n\r\n• Modern Build: Only 4 years old, offering modern peace of mind and turn-key presentation.\r\n\r\n• Luxury Finishes: Fully tiled bathrooms and low-maintenance landscaping.\r\n\r\nPrime Orewa Location:\r\n\r\nPositioned in the master-planned Ara Hills community, you are minutes from Orewa Beach, Silverdale Shopping Centre, top-rated local schools, and quick SH1 motorway connections.\r\n\r\nVendor Note: The owners have confirmed their next move and are ready to sell.\r\n\r\nCall today to book a private viewing or join us at the open home.",
